Repo AI — Project Vision
1. What is Repo AI?

Repo AI is an AI-native developer tool designed to help developers reuse knowledge, architecture, components, and features from their previous projects when building new projects.

The core idea is:

Your previous projects become an AI-powered development library.

Instead of starting every new project from scratch, Repo AI analyzes a developer's existing repositories and determines what can be reused, adapted, reimplemented, or should be avoided.

2. The Problem

Developers frequently build similar functionality across different projects.

Examples:

Authentication
Role-based access control
Payment systems
File uploads
Dashboards
REST APIs
Database models
Notification systems
Realtime communication
Admin panels

The developer may already have working implementations of these features in previous repositories.

However, finding and reusing them is often manual.

The developer has to:

Remember which repository contains the feature.
Search through the repository.
Understand how the feature works.
Determine whether it can be reused.
Adapt it to the new project's architecture.
Rewrite incompatible parts.

Repo AI aims to automate and improve this process.

3. Core Workflow

The initial system will follow this general pipeline:

