10. Engineering Rule

The project will be built incrementally.

For each major step:

Understand the concept.
Understand why it is required.
Implement a small experiment.
Test it.
Break it intentionally where useful.
Document what was learned.
Only then move to the next abstraction.

The goal is not merely to finish Repo AI.

The goal is to understand how Repo AI works deeply enough that its architecture can be defended, modified, debugged, and eventually scaled.